# =============================================================================
# Source data (PhysioNet / MIMIC-IV) — NEVER commit
# =============================================================================
# Everything under "source material/" is presumed to be restricted-access
# health data distributed under the PhysioNet Credentialed Health Data License
# 1.5.0, which forbids redistribution, and is in any case far too large for git
# (~98 GB decompressed as of Aug 2026). Only markdown documentation is tracked
# from that directory; see "source material/README.md" for what lives there
# locally and how to obtain it.
#
# Currently present locally (all excluded by the rule below):
#   source material/mimic-iv-3.1/
#   source material/mimic-iv-ed-2.2/
#   source material/mimic-iv-note-deidentified-free-text-clinical-notes-2.2/
source material/*
!source material/*.md

# =============================================================================
# Derived data, ledgers, models — NEVER commit (live in MWH_DATA_ROOT, default
# C:\mimicdata, but guard the repo tree too). Synthetic test fixtures are the
# only data-shaped files allowed, and only under mimicwarehouse/tests/fixtures/.
# =============================================================================
*.csv
*.csv.gz
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.duckdb.new
*.duckdb.tmp
*.wal
*.jsonl
*.feather
*.arrow
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.skops
*.pt
*.safetensors
# EP-165 (GOV-5): mirror mwh guard G1 — export/archive/db shapes an ad-hoc dump could take
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.gz
*.bz2
*.zst
*.xz
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.orc
*.avro
*.ndjson
*.hdf5
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
# EP-165 (GOV-6): data-root-shaped directories, anchored to the two places a mis-set root
# could land (repo root, uv project root) so future in-repo files like
# src/mimicwarehouse/data/item_units.yaml (EP-39), docs/studies/, app/models/ are NOT
# silently dropped by an unanchored pattern.
/data/
/mimicwarehouse/data/
/lake/
/mimicwarehouse/lake/
/warehouse/
/mimicwarehouse/warehouse/
/runs/
/mimicwarehouse/runs/
/models/
/mimicwarehouse/models/
/notes/
/mimicwarehouse/notes/
/studies/
/mimicwarehouse/studies/
/exports/
/mimicwarehouse/exports/
/mimicdata/
/mimicwarehouse/mimicdata/
!mimicwarehouse/tests/fixtures/**
!mimicwarehouse/tests/fixtures/**/*.csv
!mimicwarehouse/tests/fixtures/**/*.parquet

